{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:862ddc9a512fdd2e0c8d52261d5de82db4276bff692d595f1806f8fd8e784203",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c6d5ac00295ffb1c05d227003ace188dcd7d55b551843d17fdb7edc94d5364c",
      "text": "萌发于桐生心中之物",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dae15f504824e8ac1835557c2a758acba0de0130a6023704dfcb839d2e4cb215",
      "text": "桐生收到了全天跟拍采访的邀请。由于还要前往他所借住的猫柳亭金槌邸进行拍摄，制作人为了取得许可前去造访。然而桐生本人却不知为何静不下心来，表现得反常起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c6d5ac00295ffb1c05d227003ace188dcd7d55b551843d17fdb7edc94d5364c",
      "text": "萌发于桐生心中之物",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a06f62050ce43c86bba87c40d915cdbebd8f6dae36349b9c09756c699368f58c",
      "text": "喵呵呵呵～♪\n吾辈回～来啦喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c057ac8f4ad10729667bea029b0cfbb286c7bf1da5297d7e3283ae4a90bf626",
      "text": "桐生先生！你回来的时机\n刚刚好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c32dfdc1bdc677c92e7d00372b33a94287e2dc8092fae33267a09359df2ed2ec",
      "text": "唔唔，怎么了喵，\n●●●●プロデューサー君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77819c3483cd34269e7042b5976c805911a02563b8abf807f8008b8c2e612048",
      "text": "莫非，是有新工作了喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52d3f8e18663c10e0edea05b17bf96eb820864d7073b4ed98875b38f3b269e7b",
      "text": "是的。有人发来了想对桐生先生进行“全天跟拍采访”的邀请。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a757b59c0d97bb8769cfd918e406d6666c862114232f5715bb5e85185f54b4a",
      "text": "喵喵，听起来很有意思喵～！\n那么，被跟拍的吾辈，该做些什么喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16e6850441a93e96898c544999cf2e409af4a091d931494f2c6437360f3b27d5",
      "text": "“天才落语家兼偶像！想要拍摄不可思议系角色\n猫柳桐生先生在自家的日常生活！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32c3229397b5df09626d5834d1a7b21352e26b258c777e6076ce6bc3f5deef1a",
      "text": "文件上是这么写的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:08fe60b4ce8c1f25e708f566cdfea4b6d49fa3b67eba4b41ec9073ef06489413",
      "text": "原来如喵。是想看看神秘的吾辈，\n私底下的模样喵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e9c76c531f4cd2c4ace267e55c101fd4c8be707fc28bb72525579b4f2ee7cf1",
      "text": "桐生先生的家，其实是你的落语师父\n猫柳亭金槌先生的宅邸对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e38e4a56ab56135fdfa8192f719c8e5ba407bc1ab8d58ab82b257cdf7280d57c",
      "text": "然也。自打十二岁拜师以来，就一直\n承蒙横滨的师父关照了喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c932658772b40737b855e1e1a4101be06bb245bc21b079db4b731c1b7c8effdf",
      "text": "吾辈一边与师父同住，\n一边学习落语喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d094b78a0ad27baca668603a56b6eb71e588dda63d5795c618d58432a1dcb1c3",
      "text": "无论是去学校还是去事务所，都是从师父家出发……\n换言之，就有一个问题了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ec34ba964a0f13b2ddd830d17c863815c4eda4e91ea73e0e15d178c727dfd2c",
      "text": "要是没有师父的许可，\n这项工作恐怕很难办喵～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e191d835eca69684f3cce57afb6bf663ca6f96e3646e328e7c50f900ef0d764",
      "text": "那么，向师父确认一下吧！\n由我来联系他。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1234a5d3a4c09e821a90e0b4170e58d8f8f4f15002a5685c17827eeda9d4dda0",
      "text": "……事情大概就是这样。\n请问能允许我们前去府上打扰吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32266a386c03335182163f99d800fa9f4b0e182c274ad05a8f150fc84ed80236",
      "text": "啊啊，我不介意。\n详细情况直接来我家跟我谈吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a04016bb661c36e27604e759d9a25d0672faa044a2a75a0792f5a7903a54030f",
      "text": "后天我有空，\n你们正好顺便来给拍摄踩个点吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e74a3136c2a33349e13fb69ce78daf4f2eb1951162b3ea4749ec4ff5286cb723",
      "text": "（喵呼呼，师父同意了喵！\n这样一来就顺利……唔唔，也就是说？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f45732fca3d77498c65e3638113969bdeaaca91f879dfdf1fc1ce0ee7145fbd5",
      "text": "（●●●●プロデューサー君要来我家！？\n这、这是……何等良机喵！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1bce4cea8c4aad34d70e3be089846c7dc0549f56aee79dbb626514a03a7fe59",
      "text": "（好好观察●●●●プロデューサー君，\n拿来当新段子的素材喵～♪）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:303befb9a232b458c20ae821a2677ed9e77bc38928bdaa1d3ffbdb2101f81205",
      "text": "猫柳邸",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3607cd922caeb3e6957331ab1f3b2806e38adeb91b556192d08cc511eed0f4c3",
      "text": "事情我大概明白了。\n只要别碍事，爱怎么拍就怎么拍吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9d7f20bdc46a0c5b572528bf0f91c2e04f8dac963b06b5449e2afc34c02870d",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n具体日期定下来之后，我会再次与您联络的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:521526fc00529df85d13cf2b434f2984e7fea3aaaac6a4b528958afc384e460f",
      "text": "……谈话好像结束了喵，\n●●●●プロデューサー君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6755f1559f6cfbe44a9104a85e9287f9f09ddaa3a8015e5215c67d77a185ed30",
      "text": "哇。怎么突然站起来了，\n桐生先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e0f0041b4456a988bb4643a0b1c93f8936a9e568bb86671420374f787b9577a",
      "text": "要不要再续一杯茶喵？\n点心也多拿点过来喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c18474b0c327a4cc2b9bd6c500c4c5b4242391786be5533d91c48cd002037c25",
      "text": "哎不对，难道是坐垫不够多？\n要再拿一块来喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c257b72333d84b08530ddb29aa4663719164aebf8f03d17af44854d21476ca62",
      "text": "傻瓜，统统用不着。\n搞什么啊，毛毛躁躁的家伙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aa447d8b2718214ce7c1a8730b65127503f07af368e185bd9eaba6569b766d0",
      "text": "你今天不是还干劲十足地说要把这个人当成素材吗。\n安安静静观察不就得了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55fc309936551dd89ec3883f15197248ffce3f9ff9a71d44d960d197ed7aa49d",
      "text": "喵、喵喵～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9707b4c9b79063dc9f6b2cd6df8058e70d7674ee867db77253ebce19b2eb7b4",
      "text": "那、那是因为……做不到喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92e95fee33422660a9409082ffaa63224e7f9c137711524517b71bef24eaccbd",
      "text": "一看着●●●●プロデューサー君……\n表情或动作的一点点微小变化都会好在意……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2492b0809ca21390d5ec95d262cf8a78890be21f2f96929d55dce2dd17c7e70",
      "text": "坐立不安～心痒难耐～……\n不知为何，脑子和身体都静不下来喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff6d75dd282dc7e5c4d888e79307906f12bb495453f1ae2eae4a2744f65c81c2",
      "text": "啊啊，是这么回事啊。\n行了行了，那你去泡壶茶过来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a77274d09674de5f14fbcead6ba8bec783cc02ad31241623feaa8b792299aaa",
      "text": "喵喵。交给我吧喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c673029c8ed6ffa80f0f9ccb2388ecb30e7f947eebbfab94d7f3fc897d2227bc",
      "text": "桐生先生怎么了呢。\n刚才确实一直静不下心的样子……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c02e7539808706001e90c29ec73a117739101e00a228726a02c90f42d7860ea",
      "text": "那家伙啊，是在担心\n你到底有没有待得开心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acdc244b1e441809eb38d8d9b6349e2cd0d278a7a0ca38d232747cf20b25353c",
      "text": "不是脑子也不是身体，而是心在坐立难安。\n但因为不习惯这种感觉，所以陷入混乱了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b1f1aecca7193882b651096f592c9fb0f9e47462e95236fb75926d57564a0a7",
      "text": "且不论落语的说功和才能……但在你那里，\n那家伙或许也变得稍微有些感情丰富起来了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bf152df156f63caed2971d92c535b9887af8b9661b8e1e6de1b5f4301e15bcb",
      "text": "两位久等了，茶泡好啦喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f030c233632b71672d026934276b163bf5df6d5dc27ed481c81029647c3be7ce",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君！\n吾辈的全天跟拍采访，反响如何喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8589e749fd5a131c63c07a1ce8898aaf091c21c832f7f940e4700b8b21174af",
      "text": "很多观众好评说能看到桐生先生各色各样的表情，\n非常开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccbc950e5a63af0209a670e5074d26b48d617dbeda6d8baf5a89761f4eaf7cf5",
      "text": "我想以此节目为契机，\n对桐生先生感兴趣的人一定变多了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0098a7ec3005f6dde970f39a604b0f279a0ef478e100d4af3f39acc9224b4876",
      "text": "喵呵呵呵，大成功了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c2048483433bb37c6a73da0056e7347c1d89867492531c2fc2a401c18f05730",
      "text": "作为偶像不仅完成了有趣的工作，\n还到手了满满的新素材……不仅如此。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fd896053ad23c0291a656469a44d93c008c066ca32aaa696318280d7198ac7c",
      "text": "还能把●●●●プロデューサー君\n招待到家里喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:975c236877fbff756a747ccf8428bab4ac994faa7be19dbe00e48838dab2a5c9",
      "text": "净是好事，\n非常开心喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57352d12d42236ad785c2a03b54604530553cdd407504466578fc8fb190f55c8",
      "text": "吾辈还想做各种各样其他的工作呢。\n师父也叹着气支持我了喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1549174a557f77aeb6d96ba3d3b60298250a226b7eb276087cabf70c3edc7091",
      "text": "那可太感激了。正好有给桐生先生的\n新工作邀请送到了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_017kir_01_1_2_017_01:1_2_017_01_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0480caf9fd7cbd9f7af7f9f74e11dadfa5ee7a41b2e85d1783067406a8db5fa",
      "text": "喵喵～！\n快跟吾辈详细说说喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
